# ClusterEasy_FFTW3

This is a simple port of [ClusterEasy](https://www.felderbooks.com/latticeeasy/index.html) from FFTW2 to FFTW3. 

The ability for Clustereasy to output the energy density at each point in the lattice has been added. Add
"const int senergydensity=1; // LSR -- Set to 1 to output energy density values across the grid"
to parameters.h when creating a new model file. 
